    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The current installed map renders the existing custom collectible/location markers as solid black squares. This is a regression: these icons previously worked, and adding newer custom textures must never replace or invalidate older textures.\\n\\nRequired repair:\\n- Restore every existing custom map icon, not only the newest one.\\n- Use the already-proven complete resident texture-dictionary path.\\n- Remove the rejected standalone lex_blips dictionary from the live/install path.\\n- Rebuild from all original Rockstar entries plus every custom sprite; never ship a partial resident replacement.\\n- Add a build verifier that fails if any LEX_BLIP entry points to lex_blips, any referenced custom texture is absent from the complete resident archive, or the installer republishes lex_blips.ytd.\\n\\nAcceptance: after a full restart, all existing and new custom markers render their actual artwork with transparency; no black squares and no missing/corrupted vanilla icons.",
